        {
          "text": "Lino Boazi wakaya kumulyango wamunzi, wakala nkuko. Nkabela kwakainda oyo siluzubonyina Boazi ngwaakaambide. Mpawo wakati, Uwe, nyomfwi, boola, ukale okuno. Lino wakaleya, wakala. ",
