        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Boazi wakati, Mubuzuba obo mbubonya nozooula muunda kuzwa kumaanza aa-Naomi, uleelede kuula alakwe Rute mu-Moabu mukamufu, kuti ukabusye izina lyamufu mucaabilo cakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.5"
            ]
          }
