        {
          "text": "Uyookubeda sikupilusyabuumi asikukulela mubucembele bwako, nkaambo mukamwana wako uukuyandisya, uukubotela kwiinda bana balombe bali musanu ababili, nguwamuzyala. ",
          "type": "text",
